# Game of Yield — Brand UI (all sites)

Copy this file into any Game of Yield / Pensionizer / Catch KYC / Club site as:

`.cursor/rules/game-of-yield-brand-ui.mdc`

**Same brand identity. Different layout per product.** Never clone one site’s layout onto another — only share tokens, type, spacing, and UX rules.

Inspired by Medicare.gov + [Senior Planet](https://seniorplanet.org/) (plain verbs, large type, low cognitive load). Desktop Senior Planet uses licensed **Gotham**; we use open **Figtree** (their companion font) so every GY site can ship legally.

---

## 0. Porting checklist (new site)

1. Copy this rule file into `.cursor/rules/`
2. Paste CSS tokens + utilities into global CSS (`:root`, `.dark`, helpers)
3. Load **Figtree** 400/500/600/700 (e.g. `next/font/google` → `--font-figtree`)
4. Map design-system tokens (shadcn/Tailwind) → GY colors
5. Add brand stripe once near header; wordmark; skip-link; focus rings
6. Prefer A/A+/A++ + light/dark grey toggle when the product is tools/analytics
7. Apply product layout personality (section 6) — do not copy X-Ray chrome onto marketing

