## 2. Flavor rule (critical)

Logo colors are **seasoning, not the stew**.

| DO use for | DO NOT use for |
|------------|----------------|
| Thin stripe `green \| yellow \| red` | Full-page backgrounds |
| Active / selected states | Large body text |
| Score chips, badges, key metrics | Every border & button |
| One primary CTA per screen (blue) | Neon gradients / purple fintech |
| Small brand wordmarks | Competing chrome everywhere |

Wordmark pattern:

- `Game of Yield` → `--gy-green` bold
- `· Income Engine` → `--gy-red` bold
- Page title → `--gy-ink` / foreground

Primary CTA fill: `--gy-blue` + white text. Secondary: border / soft blue surface.

---

## 3. Typography & a11y (required)

### Font

- **Figtree** via Google Fonts / `next/font` (weights **400, 500, 600, 700** only)
- No Thin/Light; no script, display serif, condensed, or ultra-stylish fonts
- Mono only for tickers / numbers (e.g. JetBrains Mono) — never for body copy

### Scale (keep steps tight — labels must not look tiny vs titles)

| Token | Size | Use |
|-------|------|-----|
| `--gy-text-xs` / `sm` | 16px | Labels, tables, captions |
| `--gy-text-base` | 18px | Body, buttons, nav |
| `--gy-text-lg` | 20px | Section titles, metrics |
| `--gy-text-xl` | 22px | Page H1 |
| `--gy-text-2xl` | 24px | Max hero (rare) |

If using Tailwind, **remap** `text-xs`…`text-2xl` to these tokens so leftover `text-xs` cannot become 12px.

### A11y

- Body ≥ **18px**; line-height ~**1.55**
- Links underlined or clearly marked (not color alone)
- Tap targets ≥ **44px** (prefer **48px** / `min-h-12` for primary tasks)
- Visible focus rings (e.g. 3px `--gy-blue`)
- Skip-to-content link → `#main-content`
- Zoom-safe to 200%
- When feasible: **A / A+ / A++** text scale (`--gy-scale`: 1 / 1.08 / 1.16) on `html { font-size: calc(100% * var(--gy-scale)) }`
- Light default + dark **grey** toggle

---

## 4. Spacing (required)

Components must have **enough breathing room** — do not pack chrome.

- Section stacks: `gap: var(--gy-space-section)` (2rem) via `.gy-stack`
- Cards: generous padding (~1.5–1.75rem); soft border `--gy-border`; radius ~0.5–0.75rem
- Tables: cell padding ~12–14px vertical
- Page main: horizontal padding ≥ 1.5rem (prefer 2rem on md+)
- Avoid dense icon-only rows without labels

```css
.gy-stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--gy-space-section); }
.gy-stack-tight { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--gy-space-4); }
.gy-section-title {
  font-size: var(--gy-text-lg);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: var(--gy-tracking);
  color: var(--foreground);
  line-height: 1.35;
}
.gy-section-help {
  font-size: var(--gy-text-sm);
  color: var(--gy-muted);
  line-height: var(--gy-leading);
  max-width: 42rem;
  margin-top: 0.35rem;
}
```

