## 9. Forbidden looks

Do **not** ship:

1. Purple-on-white / purple–indigo gradient “AI fintech”
2. Warm cream + terracotta serif brochure look (unless product is explicitly that)
3. Dense broadsheet / hairline newspaper chrome
4. Neon glows, rounded-full pill spam, multi-layer shadows
5. Blue-wash dark themes (dark must stay **grey**)
6. Tiny 10–12px captions fighting large titles
7. Emoji as primary UI decoration

---

## 10. Ship checklist

- [ ] Tokens present; no rogue accent palette
- [ ] Figtree loaded; weights 400–700 only
- [ ] Flavor sparse but noticeable (stripe / accents / heat)
- [ ] Body ≥18px; tight type scale; WCAG AA
- [ ] Yellow not used for small body text; yellow chips use dark ink
- [ ] Generous spacing (`.gy-stack`, card/table padding)
- [ ] Tap targets ≥44px; focus rings; skip-link
- [ ] Plain verbs / low jargon; one clear primary action above the fold
- [ ] Layout distinct from sibling GY apps
- [ ] Dark theme (if any) = grey base, not blue wash
